{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12203090","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12203090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1220309001:0":{"text":"라프터 씨 맞으세요? 몇 가지 물어볼 게 있는데요.","source_cn":"请问你是拉夫特先生吗？我们有几个问题想找你打听。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6548D05CA67861B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1220309002:0":{"text":"쥐, 쥐다! 거대 생쥐가 또?!","source_cn":"老、老鼠！又是大老鼠？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62C9B24DD8038BC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220309003:0":{"text":"정말 무례하시네요... 마법사의 서머너를 본 적은 없어도 들어는 봤을 거 아니에요!","source_cn":"真失礼……就算没有亲眼见过魔法师的使魔，起码也听说过吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x622010A10600A8EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220309004:0":{"text":"서머너라고... 마법사는 보통 큰 쥐를 서머너로 삼나? 내가 본 것도 서머너일까?","source_cn":"使魔……魔法师都喜欢用大老鼠当使魔吗？我看见的那东西，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19AC43B8384BA9C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220309005:0":{"text":"휴... 러스트 항 사람들에게 기본적인 마법 상식을 좀 알려줘야겠네요.","source_cn":"唉……我有必要给锈锚港的人普及一些魔法常识了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FC48CEE7F940BCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220309006:0":{"text":"그건 그렇고. 어디서 큰 쥐를 봤는지 말해줄 수 있어요?","source_cn":"算了，先不说这些。你能不能告诉我们，在哪看见了大老鼠？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC34E448BB0530D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220309007:0":{"text":"바로 여기서.","source_cn":"就在这里。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7F348292B92773B4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"바로 여기서.","female":"바로 여기서.","variant_male_record_index":"132560","variant_female_record_index":"132561","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220309008:0":{"text":"한밤에 생쥐 떼가 담장 밑에 딱 붙어서 후다닥 지나가는 거야. 그걸 보고 너무 놀라서 내가 내 발을 밟았다니까!","source_cn":"当时天很黑，那群东西贴着墙根跑过去，吓得我踩了自己的脚！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x07477610459F68B1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"한밤에 생쥐 떼가 담장 밑에 딱 붙어서 후다닥 지나가는 거야. 그걸 보고 너무 놀라서 내가 내 발을 밟았다니까!","female":"한밤에 생쥐 떼가 담장 밑에 딱 붙어서 후다닥 지나가는 거야. 그걸 보고 너무 놀라서 내가 내 발을 밟았다니까!","variant_male_record_index":"132562","variant_female_record_index":"132563","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220309009:0":{"text":"가까이 가볼게요.","source_cn":"我走近点看看。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4CDAB6873DBD29B2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"가까이 가볼게요.","female":"가까이 가볼게요.","variant_male_record_index":"132564","variant_female_record_index":"132565","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220309010:0":{"text":"조심해, 치피!","source_cn":"小心啊满满！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C492FA6450C4CA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:水手拉夫特":{"text":"선원 라프터","source":"水手拉夫特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":3}}